{"3470210": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Ardent: Rise", "steam_appid": 3470210, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Summary</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ardent: Rise is a fantasy real-time action RPG with primarily tab-target, ability-driven combat, strong tank / damage / healing roles, and a multiplayer CO-OP PVE focus.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>What are the core tenets of the game?</strong> </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Implement the &quot;holy trinity&quot; (Tank, Heals, Damage) archetypes in a narrative rich environment,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create fun, thematic, and customizable RPG classes,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Focus on an exciting PVE CO-OP experience</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Play</strong> </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3D semi-open world with real-time combat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat is primarily tab-target with growing hybrid action elements (directional attacks, dodges, and positional play) in tougher encounters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >PVE CO-OP - 5 Players</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are Towns and Dungeons with NPCs and enemies/bosses</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dungeons will provide varied enemy encounters that can be increased in difficulty for more challenging play</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Characters can be leveled by gaining experience through exploration, quests, and interactions such as combat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are loot items that you can equip, which can be gained as rewards from quests and combat, or through crafting</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Abilities, Skills, Talents, and Professions can all be applied to customize your character capabilities</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mild narrative choices during story progression and world exploration</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The game is currently a limited-slice prototype and is entirely self-funded. Many of the details above are already implemented in the prototype but the full game vision as described above will depend on additional funding.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Visit our website to see information about Discord and sign up for the newsletter!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Summary</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ardent: Rise is a fantasy real-time action RPG with primarily tab-target, ability-driven combat, strong tank / damage / healing roles, and a multiplayer CO-OP PVE focus.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>What are the core tenets of the game?</strong> </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Implement the &quot;holy trinity&quot; (Tank, Heals, Damage) archetypes in a narrative rich environment,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create fun, thematic, and customizable RPG classes,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Focus on an exciting PVE CO-OP experience</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Play</strong> </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3D semi-open world with real-time combat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat is primarily tab-target with growing hybrid action elements (directional attacks, dodges, and positional play) in tougher encounters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >PVE CO-OP - 5 Players</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are Towns and Dungeons with NPCs and enemies/bosses</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dungeons will provide varied enemy encounters that can be increased in difficulty for more challenging play</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Characters can be leveled by gaining experience through exploration, quests, and interactions such as combat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are loot items that you can equip, which can be gained as rewards from quests and combat, or through crafting</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Abilities, Skills, Talents, and Professions can all be applied to customize your character capabilities</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mild narrative choices during story progression and world exploration</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The game is currently a limited-slice prototype and is entirely self-funded. Many of the details above are already implemented in the prototype but the full game vision as described above will depend on additional funding.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Visit our website to see information about Discord and sign up for the newsletter!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Ardent: Rise is a fantasy real-time action RPG with strong tank / damage / healing roles, and multiplayer CO-OP PVE focus.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470210/eafe405c239b80b8d07b936722637af96d987974/header.jpg?t=1786758060", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470210/30bad337d81d8bb0ac478f038f92510e8fb30360/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1786758060", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470210/30bad337d81d8bb0ac478f038f92510e8fb30360/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1786758060", "website": "https://www.playardent.com/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> 10+</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> 10+</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "developers": ["Potential